# env.optional — fallbacks / enrichment only; the skill runs without these.
# CRM read for live conversion/close data. If a CRM key is set -> pull close data from the
# CRM; else -> use the supplied performance file/CSV (default). The skill runs fully on the
# file alone:
HUBSPOT_API_KEY
SALESFORCE_ACCESS_TOKEN
PIPEDRIVE_API_TOKEN
# Optional SERP upgrade for the missing-benchmark lookups. If a DataForSEO (or Serper) key
# is set -> structured SERP API; else -> the agent's keyless web search (default):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
SERPER_API_KEY
